<title>ITALY: Italian GDP rose 0.7 pct in Q3 96.</title>
<headline>Italian GDP rose 0.7 pct in Q3 96.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's gross domestic product (GDP) rose by a real 0.7 percent, year-on-year, in the third quarter of 1996, national statistics institute Istat said.</p>
<p> ITALIAN GDP			   Q3 1996    Q2 1996  Q3 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		   +0.7	  +0.7    +2.6</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter   +0.6	  -0.4    +0.6</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	  349.92     347.89   333.11</p>
<p>Istat gave the following breakdown:</p>
<p> FINAL CONSUMPTION		  Q3 1996    Q2 1996    Q3 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		   +0.2	+0.3 (r)   +1.4</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter   +0.2	+0.2 (r)   +0.2</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	 272.29    271.84 (r) 271.74</p>
<p> FIXED INVESTMENTS		  Q3 1996    Q2 1996    Q3 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		  +1.2	 +2.0 (r)   +6.0</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter  +0.2	 -0.1 (r)   +1.0</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	 61.97	61.86 (r)  65.85</p>
<p> STOCK VARIATIONS		    Q3 1996    Q2 1996   Q3 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		    N/A	  N/A	 N/A</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter    N/A	  N/A	 N/A</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	  +0.45	-.17 (r)  +3.31</p>
<p> EXPORTS OF GOODS AND SERVICES   Q3 1996   Q2 1996  Q3 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		    0.0	-2.1 (r)  +12.3 (r)</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter   +2.0	+0.4 (r)   -0.2 (r)</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	  87.28     85.6 (r)   87.25</p>
<p> IMPORTS OF GOODS AND SERVICES   Q3 1996    Q2 1996  Q3 1995</p>
<p> Yr/yr growth (pct)		   -5.2	-3.6 (r)  +11.6</p>
<p> Growth versus previous quarter   +1.1	-4.4 (r)   +2.8 (r)</p>
<p> Overall value (trln lire)	  72.07     71.25 (r)  76.04</p>
<p>Note: (r) denotes revised data.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
